Even if a shopkeeper is polymorphed into something else, he still acts
like a shopkeeper.  To test this, try polymorphing a shopkeeper into
something else, and then paying him to calm him down.  You could have a 
nymph-shopkeeper, or a yellow light-shopkeeper, or a rock troll-shopkeeper.
Could make for some interesting bones levels.

Quiz for nethack know-it-alls:
  If you polymorph a shopkeeper into a little dog, pay him to calm him 
  down, what happens if you then throw a tripe ration at him?  Does he:

  a) get angry (because you threw something at a shopkeeper)
  b) become your pet (after all it is a dog)
  c) get angry, and then become peaceful (because it's schizophrenic(sp?)).
  d) always becomes angry, sometimes then becomes your pet.

I'll post the answer if no one else does.
